  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development by virtue of its, size, siting and design would be an incongruous addition to the host property and the immediate surrounding area, thereby having an unacceptable adverse impact in terms of character and appearance. As such, the proposal would be contrary with Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CS8 and DM10 of the Council's Core Strategy 2012.",
    "The proposed development by virtue of its size, siting and design and its proximity to neighbouring habitable room windows would create a dominant feature that would create unnecessary overlooking, a loss of privacy to neighbouring occupiers, and potential for noise and disturbance to the detriment of their existing living conditions. As such the proposal would not accord with policies CS8 and DM10 of the adopted LDF Core Startegy April 2012."
